From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ad5xrecon <ad5xrecon@localhost>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wizard: AD5X time zone step

A "Time Zone" step leads the AD5X setup steps, so both the first-start
wizard and the "Run Setup Wizard" session from Settings ask for it before
the self-check. It offers the zone list of Settings > Language & Time with
the current zone selected and reuses that page's callback, so a pick is
applied and saved at once by DisplaySettingsManager. Nothing runs on the
printer; Next is always allowed and the step is skipped where the other
AD5X steps are.

Upstream: not applicable (AD5X OS specific)
---
